{"term": {"label": "智", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "4A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-i", "title": "離婁上", "description": "孟子曰：「離婁之明，公輸子之巧，不以規矩，不能成方員：師曠之聰，不以六律，不能正五音；堯舜之道，不以仁政，不能平治天下。今有仁心仁聞而民不被其澤，不可法於後世者，不行先王之道也。\n「故曰，徒善不足以為政，徒法不能以自行。《詩》云：『不愆不忘，率由舊章。』遵先王之法而過者，未之有也。聖人既竭目力焉，繼之以規矩準繩，以為方", "occurrences": 3, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "反", "id": "反"}, {"form": "實", "id": "實"}, {"form": "從", "id": "從"}, {"form": "敬", "id": "敬"}, {"form": "智", "variants": [], "id": "智"}, {"form": "樂", "id": "樂"}, {"form": "求", "id": "求"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "親", "id": "親"}, {"form": "誠", "id": "誠"}, {"form": "身", "id": "身"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.2192034840549946, "source": "親", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 0.8329091229351039, "source": "親", "target": "身"}, {"weight": 1.0152306797290584, "source": "親", "target": "實"}, {"weight": 1.9315214116032138, "source": "誠", "target": "反"}, {"weight": 2.1546649629174235, "source": "誠", "target": "身"}, {"weight": 3.0301337002713233, "source": "敬", "target": "反"}, {"weight": 0.7788419016648283, "source": "反", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 3.0301337002713233, "source": "反", "target": "智"}, {"weight": 2.1138429683971682, "source": "反", "target": "求"}, {"weight": 1.2383742310432684, "source": "反", "target": "身"}, {"weight": 2.000514283090165, "source": "禮", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.336986519711378, "source": "禮", "target": "實"}, {"weight": 1.289667525430819, "source": "仁", "target": "樂"}, {"weight": 0.44236966504361536, "source": "仁", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 0.7788419016648283, "source": "仁", "target": "實"}, {"weight": 2.624668592163159, "source": "樂", "target": "實"}, {"weight": 0.9019019944220555, "source": "事", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.0560526742493137, "source": "事", "target": "身"}, {"weight": 1.2383742310432684, "source": "事", "target": "實"}, {"weight": 3.030133700